  "summary": "“ But if you keep going, and live with the problem and peel more layers of the onion off, you can oftentimes arrive at some very elegant and simple solutions.” Steve Jobs\n\n●\tLead design and development infrastructure of online game server with C++(std14) and boost library - 1yr\n●\tIntegrated Java SDK for Ali Cloud Voice Recognition Service\n●\tManaged team of 6 while maintaining online game server - 8mos\n●\tBuilt a web app for a college management system and OTS with CI framework - 6mos\n●\tBuilt a web app to show real time cryptocurrency rate using MERN - 2mos\n●\tWorked with various different libraries, REST APIs, overlooked code and confirmed pleasant UI experiences. \n●\tReported bugs and explain to different collaborative parties. \n●\tCreated a high level of trust with co-workers, and quickly became the go-to specialist for clarifications.",
