    "description": "Designed and implemented Payment process on a content-addressable, peer-to-peer storing and sharing hypermedia of distributed file system using Go to support millions of users\n\nImplemented web-session framework to establish concurrent encrypted connections in multiple gRPC calls with a private ledger, designed handshake model to guarantee atomic transactions with high security\n\nWorked on microservice of server hub to transfer data from Blockchain Network to postgreSQL Database and built a server for millions of global users, as well as supporting trillions in dollar of transactions\n\nParsed from streaming data and wrote to designed large table partition using Object-Relational Mapping(ORM) technique, increased writing rate by 50% using bulk insert and update, and query efficiency by 300% using btree, hash index and Redis to cache request results.",
